# aPToP Exercise 7(a) solution — if-then-else (case analysis form).
# Rewritten with one Netty law per step (book used "idempotence twice").

laws boolean

theorem ex7a: if a then a else ¬a fi ≡ ⊤
    if a then a else ¬a fi         case analysis
=   a ∧ a ∨ ¬a ∧ ¬a                idempotent
=   a ∨ ¬a ∧ ¬a                    idempotent
=   a ∨ ¬a                         excluded middle
=   ⊤
